        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrKo7m-PdAHDmzSRB1bjJDgzfwGKLHc4k4NTxem-ACetzTgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I came to KT Laser after mistakenly doing IPL for over a year with no results, and after only 2 sessions with Karen, the difference is almost unbelievable! She makes you feel extremely comfortable and at ease, and all your questions and concerns are answered truthfully. I’m extremely happy with my experience so far and I can’t wait to continue with laser.  I will be recommending KT Laser to all!",
        "time": 1638228042,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tamara Jurkiewicz (TamTam)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106002992552517093785/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBnTgeXoea9YyyYnma89Rv0PMd3nM6nOQxEfFBybphjw64SIjh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Been seeing Karen since last year and she’s absolutely amazing. Professional, well equipped and a pleasure to visit for all my laser removal needs. Will answer all your questions and concerns, recommend her 100%!",
        "time": 1637609833,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mimi E",
