        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie Rose Di Nunzio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107393849917460564694/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLn7NIgWLBuCQWXLM4AlmhQHcmsIjgeeWrborxNr6Dw9u68BMn6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing staff, special attention to their clients, I have very sensitive skin and they follow up with me to verify how my skin was responding. They explain every step and your comfort is top priority. Their new clinic space is beautiful and peaceful. I highly recommend this clinic, especially if you like being made to feel like you are the number one client. Amazing clinic!",
        "time": 1570730319,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brittany Batten",
